WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Ryu lands the standing-heavy-kick punish counter.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.250
Ryu moves forward while Ken crumples from heavy kick.

3
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.050
Ryu spins through Ken with heavy Tatsumaki.

4
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:03.850
Ken falls while Ryu passes to the other side.

5
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:04.200
Ryu and Ken finish with their left-right positions reversed.
